::PC_U06_L07_Q_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U06_L07_Q_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.FA.6
Question:
Which expression represents the difference quotient for f(x) in item.
{
~B. [f(x)-f(h)]/x#This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
=A. [f(x+h)-f(x)]/h#Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
~C. f(x+h)+f(x)#This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~D. h/[f(x+h)-f(x)]#This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
}

